The package kcmutils provides CMake targets:

    find_package(KF6KCMUtils CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE KF6::KCMUtils KF6::KCMUtilsCore KF6::KCMUtilsQuick)

kcmutils_generate_desktop_file() runs kcmdesktopfilegenerator at build time.
When cross-compiling, add kcmutils as a host dependency and use the generator
built for the host triplet:

    set(KF6_HOST_TOOLING "${VCPKG_INSTALLED_DIR}/${VCPKG_HOST_TRIPLET}/share")
    find_package(KF6KCMUtils CONFIG REQUIRED)
